type: dataset
title: "Hidden AGI watch"
abstract: "A daily, sourced assessment of whether advanced AI exists or acts without public knowledge: probabilities for four hypotheses, a versioned fire-alarm level, gauges, tripwires, an Escape watch and forecasts scored in public. Researched, written and published each day by a custom AI agent; the owner sets the definitions and alarm thresholds."
